          "settings": {
            "title": "BENEFITS",
            "layout": "icons",
            "items": "Best for: Thin, weak, or breaking edges — all hair types\nFeels like: Rich, earthy oil that melts on contact, never greasy\nAbsorption: Warms into scalp and strands, no buildup\nResult: Stronger strands, less breakage, calmer scalp\nFree from: Mineral oil, parabens, sulfates, silicones, fragrance\nMulti-use: Scalp, lengths, beard, and dry skin",
            "content": "<p><strong>Best for:</strong> Thin, weak, or breaking edges. Safe for all hair types — natural, relaxed, color-treated, locs, braids, and beards.</p><p><strong>Feels like:</strong> A rich, earthy oil that melts on contact and leaves hair soft, not greasy.</p><p><strong>Absorption:</strong> Warms into the scalp and strands without buildup or heaviness.</p><p><strong>Result:</strong> Stronger strands, less breakage, a calmer scalp, and visibly healthier hair with consistent use.</p><p><strong>Free from:</strong> No mineral oil, parabens, sulfates, silicones, or fragrance. One ingredient only.</p><p><strong>Multi-use:</strong> Scalp massage, pre-wash treatment, sealing moisture, beard care, and dry skin.</p>",
            "open_default": true
          }
